- Andras Gyorgy, Pooria Joulani. "Adapting to Delays and Data in Adversarial Multi-Armed Bandits." ICML 2021 / arXiv:2010.06022. Relevance: delay/data-adaptive adversarial bandit bounds and skipping; candidate for adaptive truncation route.

