+If known deterministic schedules satisfy \(H_T\log K_T=o(T)\), \(T/K_T=o(T)\), and \(\Delta_T(H_T)=o(T)\), the delayed-grid algorithm has sublinear regret. A sharper comparator-gap variant also works: with
