+## LB-008: Horizon/Process-Aware Pseudo-Regret Collapse
+
+For an exogenous policy-independent law \(P\), define
+\[
+V_T^P(a)=\mathbb E_P\sum_{t=1}^T r_t(a),
+\qquad
+V_T^{*,P}=\sup_{a\in[0,1]}V_T^P(a).
