+then \(R_{1/2}=N/2-G_{1/2}\) and \(R_1=N-G_1\), with comparator values interpreted as suprema. For every \(a\in[0,1]\),
+\[
+\frac12 a1\{a<1/2\}+\frac12 a1\{a<1\}\le\frac12,
