+\[
+\sup_{c\in\{1/2,1\}}R^\pi(I_c^N)\ge\frac{R_{1/2}+R_1}{2}\ge N/4.
+\]
+An epsilon version comparing to \(1/2-\eta\) and \(1-\eta\) gives \(N(1/4-\eta)\). Status: accepted for universal/minimax lower-bound use.
