+\[
+R_T
+=\sup_a V_T(a)-\mathbb E\sum_t r_t(a_t)
+\le
+\sup_a V_T(a)-\mathbb E\sum_t r_t^H(a_t)
+=R_T^H+\Gamma_T(H).
+\]
+Moreover \(\Gamma_T(H)\le\Delta_T(H)\). Status: accepted; still only sufficient, not known necessary.
