+- Added the sharper comparator-gap truncation penalty \(\Gamma_T(H)=\sup_a V_T(a)-\sup_a V_T^H(a)\le\Delta_T(H)\), which gives \(R_T\le R_T^H+\Gamma_T(H)\).
